**Provider Cards Data:**

| Provider | Player ID | Voice Count | Languages | API Key Required | Badge |
|----------|-----------|-------------|-----------|-----------------|-------|
| Pro Player (WebSpeech) | 2 | Browser voices | Multilingual | No | Default Pro |
| AtlasVoice GTTS | 3 | 200+ | 40+ | No (built-in) | Recommended |
| Google Cloud TTS | 4 | 300+ | 40+ | Yes (JSON file) | Popular |
| ChatGPT TTS | 5 | 6 HD voices | 57 | Yes (OpenAI key) | Premium |
| ElevenLabs | 6 | 1000+ | 29 | Yes (API key) | Most Natural |

**Note:** Don't mention "multilingual support" to users on this step. Multilingual language mapping is handled separately via the Listening tab (shown on Finish screen only if a multilingual plugin is detected).

**Production Toggle Logic:**
- "Yes, set as my default player" → Directly updates `tta_customize_settings.buttonSettings.id` to selected player ID
- "No, just exploring" → Does NOT change `buttonSettings.id` (keeps current)

**No extra state saved.** The wizard only reads/writes `tta_customize_settings.buttonSettings.id` directly. No intermediate `selectedProvider` or `useInProduction` options are stored.

