### Step 3: Voice & Language Configuration

> "Pick your voice and language"

**Purpose:** Select language and voice for the chosen provider. Includes audio preview so users hear the AI quality immediately — the "aha moment."

**UI Layout (adapts per provider):**

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Step 3 of 5                                                    │
