**Cross-promo plugins:**
- AI Workflow Automation: `https://wordpress.org/plugins/ai-workflow-automation-ai-agent-hub/`
- AR/VR 3D Model: `https://wordpress.org/plugins/ar-vr-3d-model-try-on/`

Only shown on the Finish step — subtle, non-intrusive, presented as "More from AtlasAiDev" section.

**Multilingual detection on Finish screen:**
- Only shown when `window.ttsObjPro.compatible` detects one of: WPML (`sitepress-multilingual-cms/sitepress.php`), GTranslate (`gtranslate/gtranslate.php`), or TranslatePress (`translatepress-multilingual/index.php`)
- Does NOT mention "multilingual support" — only says "We noticed [plugin name] is active on your site"
- Button links to `admin.php?page=text-to-audio#/listening` (Listening tab where the full mapping UI already exists)
- **Safe to click:** By the time Step 6 renders, all settings are saved and `tta_pro_onboarding_completed = true` is already set. Navigating away won't re-trigger the wizard.
- Multilingual mapping is NOT included as a wizard step — it's too complex (3 fields × N languages) and the Listening tab already has a polished card-based UI for it

